WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.723 --> 00:00:09.319
Every posted week has a short audio lecture written by your professor. This page lists them all in one place, ready to play.

2
00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:17.373
Press play on any week. The lecture keeps playing while you move around the site, so you can listen while you work.

3
00:00:17.373 --> 00:00:27.708
Know whose voice it is. Your professor wrote each lecture; it is read by the Eleven Labs Narrator, an AI-generated voice, for clarity and accessibility.

4
00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:38.722
Use it to catch up, not to replace. The lecture is your catch-up if you missed the live class. The readings still carry the citations and evidence your graded work needs.

5
00:00:38.722 --> 00:00:48.691
Open the week page for more. The week page has the same lecture with a follow-along transcript, a download button, and voice and language options.

6
00:00:48.691 --> 00:00:51.292
Nothing here is graded.

7
00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:56.905
Where next: Open the current week's page and read along with the transcript.
